                <pb facs="d136-02" n="2" xml:id="d136-02"/>

                <head>Attachment</head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#underline">Translation of Cuban Government Note to Swiss Embassy
                        Havana-November 19, 1972</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#center">(Complimentary introduction and close omitted)</p>
                <p>The Government of Cuba looks with equal pleasure on the disposition of the
                    Government of the United States to reach an agreement on hijackings of aircraft
                    and other offenses, in response to the Cuban note of October 30.</p>
                <p>The Cuban side is ready to take the appropriate steps in this connection. The
                    conversations can be held in the city of Havana between officials of the
                    Government of Cuba and the Embassy of Switzerland as representative of the
                    interests of the United States in our country.</p>
                <p>In the course of next week the Government of Cuba is prepared to establish the
                    pertinent contacts for this purpose with officials of the Embassy of Switzerland
                    in order to begin immediately to discuss said agreement.</p>
            </div>
